  "title": "SC 624 (2008 Regular Session): Suspend rules for drafting, etc.; authorize restoration of suffrage, require certain ID to vote, and early voting pilot program.",
  "urls": [
    "https://billstatus.ls.state.ms.us/2008/pdf/history/SC/SC0624.xml",
